#: times.cpp:26
msgid ""
"The Ancient Egyptians believed it was 360 days long, resulting in there "
"being 360 degrees in a circle.  For the sake of Konv, a day is considered "
"365.25637 days. (A sidereal year)"
msgstr ""
"Die Antieke Egiptenare geglo dit was 360 dae lang, gevolglik in daar te wees "
"360 grade in 'n sirkel.  Vir Die geval van Konv, 'n dag is oorweeg 365.25637 "
"dae. ('n sidereal jaar)"

