#: mass.cpp:22
msgid ""
"This is given as multiples of the mass of electrons, which are much less "
"massive than protons.  Electrons are negatively charged."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is gegewe as veelvoude van die massa van elektrone, wat word baie "
"minder massief as protone.  elektrone word negatief gelaai."

#: mass.cpp:23
msgid ""
"An Atomic Mass Unit is equal to about 1/12th the mass of a Carbon-12 "
"nucleus, or about that of a proton."
msgstr ""
"'n Atomic Massa Eenheid is gelyk na aangaande 1/12ste die Massa van 'n "
"Carbon-12 nukleus, van aangaande wat van 'n proton."

#: mass.cpp:24
msgid ""
"This result is given as multiples of the mass of a proton. A proton has a "
"significantly larger mass than an electron.  Protons are positively charged. "
"These are also very close to Atomic Mass Units."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie resultaat is gegewe as veelvoude van die massa van 'n proton. 'n "
"proton het 'n beduidend grootter massa as 'n elektron.  Protone word "
"positief gelaai. Hierdie word asook baie maak toe na Atomic massa Eenhede."

#: mass.cpp:30
msgid ""
"The weight of something under the effect of the gravity of Earth in "
"Washington DC, at sea level (9.801m/s^2)."
msgstr ""
"Die gewig van iets onder Die effek van Die gravitasie van Aarde in "
"Washington Dc, na see vlak (9.801m/s^2)."

#: mass.cpp:31
msgid ""
"Since pounds are a measurement of weight, not mass, this is assumed to be "
"the weight on Earth.  The full explanation is under Slugs."
msgstr ""
"Sedert ponde word 'n afmeting van gewig, nie massa, hierdie is aangeneem na "
"wees die gewig op Aarde.  die volgrote verduideliking is onder Slugs."

#: mass.cpp:32
msgid ""
"A unit of measurement of weight, commonly used in Britain and not America.  "
"No 's' is appended for plural."
msgstr ""
"'n eenheid van afmeting van gewig, algemeen gebruik word in Britanje en nie "
"Amerika.  Nee 's' is agteraaan bygevoeg vir meervoud."

#: mass.cpp:33
msgid ""
"Slugs are actual units for mass in imperial units, not weight!  Pounds are a "
"measure of weight, not mass.  Pounds are to newtons as kilograms are to "
"slugs."
msgstr ""
"slugs word ware eenhede vir massa in imperialistiese eenhede, nie gewig!  "
"Ponde word 'n meet van gewig, nie massa.  Ponde word na newtons as kilo "
"gramme word na slugs."

#: mass.cpp:35
msgid "Officially known as Short Tons"
msgstr "Amptelik bekend as Kort Tonne"

